  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきな　みみで　じめんを　ほって\nすあなを　つくる。ひとばんじゅう\nやすまずに　ほりつづけられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "커다란 귀로 땅을 파고\n보금자리를 만든다. 하룻밤 동안\n쉬지 않고 계속 팔 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses larges oreilles lui permettent de creuser\ndes terriers. Il est capable de forer sans s’arrêter\npendant toute une nuit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinen großen Ohren schaufelt es sich einen Bau.\nEs kann die ganze Nacht ohne Pause durchschaufeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa sus grandes orejas para excavar en la tierra y así\ncrear madrigueras. Puede pasarse una noche entera\ncavando sin parar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Scava tane nel terreno grazie alle grandi orecchie.\nPuò andare avanti senza fermarsi per tutta la notte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They use their large ears to dig burrows.\nThey will dig the whole night through.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大きな　耳で　地面を　掘って\n巣穴を　作る。\n一晩中　休まずに　掘り続けられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa sus grandes orejas para excavar en la tierra y así\ncrear madrigueras. Puede pasarse una noche entera\ncavando sin parar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "シャベルのような　みみを　もつ。\nあなほりで　きたえた　みみは　ふとい\nねっこを　たちきる　いりょくだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "삽과 같은 귀를 가졌다.\n구멍을 파는 데 단련된 귀는 두꺼운\n뿌리를 자를 정도의 위력이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est doté d’oreilles ressemblant à des pelles.\nÀ force de creuser des galeries, leur puissance est\ntelle qu’elles peuvent trancher de grosses racines.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es besitzt schaufelähnliche Ohren, die durch ständiges\nGraben so kräftig werden, dass sie auch dicke Wurzeln\ndurchtrennen können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene unas orejas tan grandes que parecen palas.\nLas ha fortalecido tanto usándolas para excavar que\nson capaces de arrancar raíces bien gruesas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa le orecchie come pale per scavare buche\nnel terreno. Queste propaggini sono talmente potenti\nda permettergli di strappare via enormi radici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has ears like shovels. Digging holes\nstrengthens its ears so much that they\ncan sever thick roots effortlessly.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
